<title>JAPAN: Eidai Kako -6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Eidai Kako -6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		  6.31		vs	    4.83</p>
<p> Operating	  583    million	  vs	  317    million</p>
<p> Current	    595    million	  vs	  283    million</p>
<p> Net		  285    million	  vs	  164    million</p>
<p> EPS		   43.89 yen	  vs	   27.38 yen</p>
<p> Shares		7 million	  vs	   6 million</p>
<p> Interim div	   nil		vs	     nil</p>
<p>NOTE - Eidai Kako Co Ltd makes materials for airconditioners and refrigerators.</p>
</text>
